    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Is there a way we can disable specific notification? Actually I want to disable `null-ls` notifications but allow other LSP server notifications like `tsserver`",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is there a way we can disable specific notification? Actually I want to disable <code class=\"notranslate\">null-ls</code> notifications but allow other LSP server notifications like <code class=\"notranslate\">tsserver</code></p>",
    "bodyText": "Is there a way we can disable specific notification? Actually I want to disable null-ls notifications but allow other LSP server notifications like tsserver",
